      "writtenOn": "2023-09-22T11:50:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`include_srcs` is not what we want. That includes the sources in the \"resource jar\". I doubt zipping up some text files is going to meaningfully slow down `checkbuild`, compared to all the other stuff it\u0027s doing. What I think matters more is perhaps space use, but I think sources compress fairly well.",
      "parentUuid": "9df6ab37_f098fde9",
