        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-20T17:50:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The alternative to avoid creating all the individual srcjar rules would be to export a depset of srcJarArgs and srcJarDeps, which the final platform_bootclasspath module could collect and create a single rule to create a single final srcjar.",
      "parentUuid": "91e38a77_d4003e0f",
      "revId": "3a691bda2abfb508b8189c25d633d98d2db61aec",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "157d1f0e_227e05cb",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060959
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-21T09:33:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "- Size change: 4,339 MB -\u003e 4,371 MB (.7% increase)\n\n- re depset of jarArgs: I was hoping I would be able to make `platform_bootclasspath` also be able to deal with prebuilt `java_sdk_library`, by simply exporting a depset of srcjars from it like `java_library`. That probably would not work as well for `srcJarArgs`? OTOH `platform_bootclasspath` could be special cased to deal with both scenarios rather than be agnostic. No strong opinion from me, LMK what you think",
      "parentUuid": "4d3527bd_f21ae709",
      "revId": "3a691bda2abfb508b8189c25d633d98d2db61aec",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "dd1efaf9_824933a6",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-22T17:46:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": ".7% is pretty high for rules that will never be executed 99% of the time.  It seems worth using depsets of `srcJarArgs`, and then combine it with a `merge_zips` of srcjars from `java_sdk_library` dependencies?",
      "parentUuid": "157d1f0e_227e05cb",
      "revId": "3a691bda2abfb508b8189c25d633d98d2db61aec",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
